                <mxCell id="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-99" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;This can be tricky for future blocks since we don&#39;t know the previous snapshot so the check should be:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if (previousSnapshot){&lt;br&gt;check is participant in snapshot.participants&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;else{&lt;br&gt;check is participant in Union(&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;onChainSnapshot.particpants,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;onChain.pendingParticipants)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-98" vertex="1">
